@Smf.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Public endpoints

GET {{Smf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pages/home?lang=en
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Smf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/news?lang=en&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Smf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events?lang=en
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Smf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/results?medal=gold
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Smf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/results/stats
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Smf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/settings
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{Smf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "phone": "0500000000",
  "subject": "Question",
  "message": "Hello, I have a question."
}

###

### Auth

# @name login
POST {{Smf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

###

### Admin endpoints (requires the token returned by /api/auth/login above)

GET {{Smf.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

###
